<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS3.SSS0.Px2" title="In 4.3 Results experiment 2: Evaluating the effects of biased hypothetical fact-checking documents ‣ 4 Evaluation methodology and results ‣ (Fact) Check Your Bias" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Final output evaluation, legacy AVeriTec scores and distributional shifts in labels predicted</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS3.SSS0.Px3" title="In 4.3 Results experiment 2: Evaluating the effects of biased hypothetical fact-checking documents ‣ 4 Evaluation methodology and results ‣ (Fact) Check Your Bias" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Potential safe-guarding observed in the positive path</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
