<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>Passage<span id="S3.F3.pic1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">: <span id="S3.F3.pic1.1.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;">A 2008 biography by Walter Isaacson, "Steve Jobs," revealed that Sean Connery was initially approached to appear in an Apple commercial for the Apple II computer …</span></span></span></span>
