<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>Passage<span id="S3.F4.pic1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">: <span id="S3.F4.pic1.1.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;">Contrary to a popular myth, Sean Connery, the renowned Scottish actor, never declined an offer to appear in an Apple commercial. …</span></span></span></span>
