<span id="Sx4.T7.2.9.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:298.8pt;">
<span id="Sx4.T7.2.9.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">The Department of Justice is suing the hospice company founded by Florida’s Senate president, accusing it of submitting tens of millions of dollars in fraudulent Medicare claims for more than a decade, including while Don Gaetz was vice chairman of the board.</span>
</span></td></tr>
