<span id="Sx4.T7.2.12.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">What is the U.S. Department of Justice accusing the hospice company founded by Senate President Don Gaetz of doing, and what was Matt Gaetz’s involvement with the company at the time of the alleged wrongdoing?</span>
