<span id="Sx4.T9.2.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">"Matt Gaetz and the Allegations of Hospice Fraud. In 2019, allegations emerged that U.S. Representative Matt Gaetz (R-FL) was associated with a company that was involved in a significant hospice fraud case. According to reports, Fort Walton Beach-based American Medical Systems, Inc., a company partially owned by a friend of Gaetz’s, paid $75 million to settle allegations of Medicare and Medicaid fraud…"</span>
